    "notes": [
      "Adds owner-controlled Outcome capture after an Action reaches Completed.",
      "Outcomes support usefulness, owner-reported result, time spent, optional notes, measurable results, follow-up date and measured/owner-reported/estimated/unknown evidence classification.",
      "Outcome persistence retains exact Opportunity, Goal and Knowledge Pack provenance and rejects stale writes with PostgreSQL row-version concurrency.",
      "Outcome capture creates a transparent product-domain Business Memory projection with stable keys and explicit source metadata.",
      "Outcome-derived Business Memory is inspectable and deletable without mutating historical Action or Opportunity records.",
      "Mobile Outcome capture is integrated into Opportunity Detail and Business Memory is surfaced in the existing Settings screen; PES navigation and framework structure are unchanged.",
      "CI #131, Security baseline #123 and Product intake #108 passed on the certified implementation SHA.",
      "Runtime remains disabled outside development/test and deployment is not authorized."
    ]
  },
